@node Top
@top Emacsvox Generated Reference

This manual is the exact, machine-generated reference for Emacsvox commands,
options, and default keymaps.  It is exhaustive reference material rather than
a first-use guide.  Start with the
@ref{Top,Emacsvox User Manual,,emacsvox,Emacsvox User Manual} for installation,
first speech, basic use, supported workflows, customization, and
troubleshooting.

Do not edit the included chapters directly.  Regenerate them from current
Emacsvox byte-code with @command{make docs-generate}.  Copying terms are in
@ref{Copyright,Copyright,,emacsvox,Emacsvox User Manual}.

